> quests docs/examples/riverhold
quests:
  circle_rite — The Ashen Rite — from ashen_circle — 1 stage — needs standing 10.00 with ashen_circle
  dock_inspection — Inspecting the Docks — from city_watch, in watch_career — 1 stage
  harbour_errands — Harbour Errands — from city_watch, in watch_career — 1 stage
  lost_dog — The Captain's Dog — from captain_hale, in watch_career — 1 stage
  lost_ring — Ava's Lost Ring — from merchant_ava — 1 stage
  night_patrol — Night Patrol — from city_watch, in watch_career — 1 stage
  smugglers_cove — The Smugglers' Cove — from city_watch, in watch_career — 2 stages — needs watch_oath.patrol.report done
  the_long_winter — The Long Winter — the world's own — 1 stage
  watch_captain — Captain of the Watch — from city_watch, in watch_career — 1 stage
  watch_oath — The Watch's Oath — from city_watch, in watch_career — 2 stages — needs not to be in lantern_guild
questlines:
  watch_career — A Life in the Watch — from city_watch — 4 steps
    1. watch_oath
    2. 2 of night_patrol, dock_inspection, smugglers_cove, in any order; the rest close
    3. any of harbour_errands, lost_dog, or none
    4. watch_captain — needs standing 40.00 with city_watch, and rank sergeant or higher in city_watch
> quests docs/examples/riverhold lost_dog
lost_dog — The Captain's Dog — from captain_hale, in watch_career at step 3
1. search
   found_it — standing: city_watch 2.00, captain_hale 10.00 — then the end
> quests docs/examples/riverhold watch_oath
watch_oath — The Watch's Oath — from city_watch, in watch_career at step 1 — needs not to be in lantern_guild
1. patrol
   report — outcome turned_in_vex — then oath
   look_away — outcome took_a_bribe — then the end
2. oath — needs standing 10.00 with city_watch
   swear — alignment: law 5.00, good 0.00 — then the end
